# Round 96: emit_int's LITERAL leaf emitted a bare C constant, which C
# types `int` whenever it fits -- so a "proven-integer" expression whose
# leaves are all literals computed in 32 BITS while rounds 72/73/74 priced
# the admission budget at 2^53. The budget was tightened three times
# against 2^63 and 2^53 and never once against the width the emitted C
# actually uses (invariant 14, on the arc built to enforce a bound).
#
#   65536 * 65536        VM 4294967296    AOT 0
#   1000000 * 1000000    VM 1e12          AOT -727379968
#   if (1000000 * 1000000) > 0:  VM takes the branch, AOT does NOT
#
# The ident leaf was safe by accident (int-classified names are declared
# `long`), which is why `a * a` matched where the literal form did not --
# and literals ABOVE INT_MAX also matched, because C types those `long`
# already. That boundary is what pins the diagnosis, so it is pinned here.
print of (65536 * 65536)
print of (1000000 * 1000000)
print of (100000 * 100000)
print of (50000 * 50000)
print of (2000000000 + 2000000000)
print of (46341 * 46341)
